            "locus_first": "Book II, Chapter 4",
            "locus_last": "Book II, Chapter 5",
            "summary": "Winter survival of mites on the cluster, the brood break as the point of greatest vulnerability, and why treatment timed to it removes the largest share of the population."
          }
        ]
